# METHOD 🔟 — 3Sum / 4Sum

Ye advanced Two Pointer application hai.

Example concept:

```text
3Sum
```

Pehle ek element fix karte hain:

```text
        fixed
          ↓
[ 1  2  3  4  5  6 ]
```

Baaki part me Two Pointer:

```text
fixed | left       right
  ↓       ↑           ↑
[ 1  |  2   3   4   5  6 ]
```

Then pair-sum style logic use hota hai.

So:

```text
3Sum =
Fix one element
      +
Two Pointer for remaining part
```

Similarly:

```text
4Sum =
Fix elements
      +
Two Pointer
```

