# 13. Two Pointer vs Brute Force

## Brute Force

Pair problem:

```text
i
 ↓
[1 2 3 4 5]
   j
```

Har possible pair check:

```text
O(n²)
```

---

## Two Pointer

Sorted array:

```text
[1 2 3 4 5]
 ↑       ↑
 L       R
```

Unnecessary possibilities eliminate karte jaate hain.

Often:

```text
O(n)
```

after sorting.

---

# 14. Complexity Notes

### Without sorting

Agar array already sorted hai:

```text
Two Pointer = O(n)
Space = O(1)
```

### With sorting

Agar pehle sort karna pada:

```text
Sorting = O(n log n)
Two Pointer = O(n)
```

Overall:

```text
O(n log n)
```

---

